#article(
    title: "Snippets",
    published: "2025-01-02",
    updated: "2025-03-04",
    summary: [An article that includes snippets, so that include-snippet stays covered.],
)

= Whole File

The whole file, syntax highlighted based on its extension:

#include-snippet("hello.go")

= Part Of A File

Only the body, with an explicit display name:

#include-snippet("hello.go", lines: "5..7", display: "the body")
